1
00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:03.269
In this course, you learned how to build a multi-agent system

2
00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:06.239
that transforms your structured and unstructured data

3
00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:07.941
into a Knowledge Graph.

4
00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.845
You learned how to set up each specialized agent in your system,

5
00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:14.547
what prompt to use and what tools to define,

6
00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.950
and how to share context among the agents.

7
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.853
Congratulations on completing this course,

8
00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.922
and I'm looking forward to seeing what you'll build on your own.
